@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white

title Notification method selection at startup

actor Administrator
participant "External configuration" as Config
participant "Channel composition" as Composition
participant "Installed channel registry" as Registry
participant SMSNotificationService as SMS
participant EmailNotificationService as Email
participant WebhookNotificationService as Webhook
participant LendingServiceImpl as Lending

Administrator -> Config : Set enabled notification channels\n(by identifier) before startup

Composition -> Config : Read channel identifier list
Config --> Composition : Configured value

Composition -> Composition : Parse and validate list
Composition -> Registry : Resolve identifiers / validate uniqueness
Registry --> Composition : Matching implementations\nor validation error

alt Invalid configuration
  Composition -> Composition : Throw configuration exception
  note right of Composition
    Application startup fails.
    Error is reported in application logs.
  end note
else Valid configuration
  opt SMS channel enabled
    Composition -> SMS ** : new SMSNotificationService
  end
  opt Email channel enabled
    Composition -> Email ** : new EmailNotificationService
  end
  opt Webhook channel enabled
    Composition -> Webhook ** : new WebhookNotificationService
  end
  Composition -> Lending : Inject enabled instances\n(typed as INotificationService)
  note over Composition,Lending
    Only enabled implementations are instantiated;
    disabled channels send 0 notifications.
    LendingServiceImpl depends only on INotificationService.
    Configuration changes require a restart.
  end note
end

@enduml